text:
I did not believe the hype until I tried it myself.

@FishAudio actually lets you direct the AI just like a real actor.

This is a huge step forward.

Uncle Roger getting bullied by his own voice is the best thing online today.

@FishAudio made his clone way too smart.

I cannot stop laughing.

New model from @FishAudio ! Congrats @rissa_cao and @FishAudio for the new model! Gotta try now! And whoa the views already 🤯

@FishAudio の新しいTTSモデル！
@rissa_cao 、@FishAudio チーム、おめでとう！すぐ試します。そして、すでにimpressionがやばすぎる笑🤯

Watching Uncle Roger get roasted by a clone of his own voice is so funny.

@FishAudio didn't just build a voice tool.

They built a digital bully.

ONE WORD OFF? FIX ONE WORD.

@FishAudio's Drama 3 lets you edit individual words, direct emotion in plain English and switch voices mid-sentence.

Open-weight, too.

The best part about Drama 3 is not even the voice quality.

It is the fact that I do not have to restart the whole clip just because the AI said one word wrong.

@FishAudio just saved me so much time.

Open-source continues proving its value as a growth engine for AI. ✨

@FishAudio  latest Drama 3 is an absolute masterclass: no more audio tags, no more full-file regenerations just to fix one word. 

Huge win for builders.🚀
